# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide explains how to configure the Pauli term truncation mechanism provided by the [qiskit_addon_obp.utils.truncating](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#module-qiskit_addon_obp.utils.truncating) module.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapaliwanag ng gabay na ito kung paano i-configure ang mekanismo ng Pauli term truncation na ibinibigay ng module na [qiskit_addon_obp.utils.truncating](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#module-qiskit_addon_obp.utils.truncating).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operator backpropagation (OBP) can be used to reduce the depth of quantum circuits at the cost of a more complex observable. In order to get meaningful results from OBP, one usually needs to truncate terms from their observable to prevent it from growing too large. One way to allow for deeper backpropagation into the circuit, while preventing the operator from growing too large, is to truncate terms with small coefficients, rather than adding them to the operator. Truncating terms can result in fewer quantum circuits to execute, but doing so results in some error in the final expectation value calculation, proportional to the magnitude of the truncated terms' coefficients.\n"
msgstr "Magagamit ang operator backpropagation (OBP) para bawasan ang depth ng mga quantum circuit kapalit ng mas masalimuot na observable. Para makakuha ng makabuluhang resulta mula sa OBP, karaniwang kailangang mag-truncate ng mga term mula sa observable para hindi ito lumaki nang sobra. Isang paraan para makapag-backpropagate nang mas malalim sa circuit habang pinipigilang lumaki nang sobra ang operator ay ang pag-truncate ng mga term na maliit ang coefficient, sa halip na idagdag ang mga ito sa operator. Ang pag-truncate ng mga term ay maaaring magresulta sa mas kaunting quantum circuit na kailangang i-execute, ngunit nagdudulot ito ng kaunting error sa huling kalkulasyon ng expectation value, na proporsyonal sa laki ng mga coefficient ng mga na-truncate na term.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [backpropagate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/qiskit-addon-obp#backpropagate) method takes an optional [TruncationErrorBudget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncationerrorbudget), which configures the truncation of low-weight Pauli terms for each observable after the successful backpropagation of every slice.\n"
"The amount of terms that are truncated depends on various configuration parameters specified by the user.\n"
"As of now, only a single truncation strategy is available - the [truncate_binary_search](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncate_binary_search) method.\n"
"Given an observable and some _budget_ it will perform a binary search over the Pauli terms and coefficients within that observable to find the optimal threshold,\n"
"such that the sum of the truncated coefficients is maximal but lower than the budget.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang method na [backpropagate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/qiskit-addon-obp#backpropagate) ay tumatanggap ng opsyonal na [TruncationErrorBudget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncationerrorbudget), na nagko-configure ng pag-truncate ng mga low-weight na Pauli term para sa bawat observable pagkatapos ng matagumpay na backpropagation ng bawat slice.\n"
"Ang dami ng mga term na na-truncate ay nakadepende sa iba't ibang configuration parameter na tinukoy ng user.\n"
"Sa ngayon, iisang truncation strategy lang ang available - ang method na [truncate_binary_search](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncate_binary_search).\n"
"Kapag binigyan ng isang observable at ilang _budget_, magsasagawa ito ng binary search sa mga Pauli term at coefficient sa loob ng observable na iyon para hanapin ang pinakamainam na threshold,\n"
"such that the sum of the truncated coefficients is maximal but lower than the budget.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note**: By default, the L1 norm is used to evaluate and bound the truncation error; however, the `p_norm` setting enables the specification of the Lp-norm to be used.\n"
"For more information on how to use that setting, refer to the [Use different Lp-norms for Pauli term truncation](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp/guides/bound-error-using-p-norm) guide.\n"
"The following examples illustrate various ways of building an [TruncationErrorBudget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncationerrorbudget) by using the accompanying [setup_budget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#setup_budget) function.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Tandaan**: Bilang default, ginagamit ang L1 norm para i-evaluate at i-bound ang truncation error; gayunpaman, pinapayagan ng setting na `p_norm` na tukuyin ang Lp-norm na gagamitin.\n"
"Para sa higit pang impormasyon kung paano gamitin ang setting na iyon, tingnan ang gabay na [Use different Lp-norms for Pauli term truncation](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp/guides/bound-error-using-p-norm).\n"
"Ilalarawan ng mga sumusunod na halimbawa ang iba't ibang paraan ng pagbuo ng [TruncationErrorBudget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncationerrorbudget) gamit ang kasamang function na [setup_budget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#setup_budget).\n"

